        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Bill Withers, Donna Weiss, Jackie DeShannon\n- Songs: an edited version of Bill Withers's Grammy Award-winning soul hit, the song written and composed by Donna Weiss and Jackie DeShannon\n- Albums: Winelight\n- Charts: Billboard Hot 100\n\nFacts:\n- An edited version of Bill Withers's Grammy Award-winning soul hit from the album Winelight reached number two on the Billboard Hot 100.\n- A song written and composed by Donna Weiss and Jackie DeShannon spent nine weeks at number one on the Billboard Hot 100 ahead of that Bill Withers song.",
